## Trigger workflow (do all steps)

1. Read TalentRank magazine template: `E:\Projects\talentrank-app\web\app\blog\[slug]\magazine\` for layout patterns (FAQ accordion, tag pills, section badge).
2. Create `src/data/blog/{topic}Guide.en.ts` + `.ru.ts` (never inline in huge `postsEn.ts`).
3. Import into `postsEn.ts` / `postsRu.ts` array.
4. Generate hero + 1 inline SVG in `/public/blog/` — finCalc blue (`#3B72C4`, `#2B5CA8`, `#EBF3FF`).
5. Add EN+RU URL pair to `public/sitemap.xml` with hreflang.
6. Validate meta lengths + ~0.8% main-KW density in body `text:` blocks before shipping.
7. Build must pass (`npm run build`).

## Meta & slug rules (strict)

- **metaTitle**: 51–59 characters. Main KW **required**. Must end with ` | FinanceCalculator` (pipe + brand).
- **metaDescription**: 151–159 characters. Main KW **required**.
- **slug**: descriptive, hyphenated, locale-specific; paired via `topicKey`.
- **KW density**: ~0.8% for main KW in body paragraphs (count `text:` blocks only; vary with synonyms elsewhere).

## Content structure (every article)

- `topicKey`, `articleSection`, `datePublished`, `dateModified`, `readingTimeMinutes`, `author: "FinanceCalculator Editorial"`
- `keyPhrases` → sidebar tag pills (already wired)
- Blocks: intro `p`, multiple `h2`, `h3` FAQ ids `faq-*` + answer `p` (accordion + FAQPage schema)
- **1–2 internal links** via `{ t: "link", internal: true }` — calculator page + related blog
- **1–2 external links** via `{ t: "link", nofollow: true }` — authoritative refs (CFPB/FTS/CBR etc.)
- `sources[]` at bottom (nofollow on render)
- `calcLink` button to matching calculator
- `callout` disclaimer at end

## SEO + AEO + GEO + AIO + SXO checklist

| Pillar | Apply in article |
|--------|------------------|
| **SEO** | Keyword cluster in H2s, internal links, sitemap, canonical via existing `seo.ts` |
| **AEO** | 40–60 word direct answers in FAQ; How-To steps; "People also ask" style h3 |
| **GEO** | Factual tables, entity-rich numbers, E-E-A-T author, cited sources, clear headings |
| **AIO** | Consistent brand "FinanceCalculator", factual tone, structured blocks (no raw HTML) |
| **SXO** | Strong calc CTA, scannable TOC, excerpt matches intent, no fluff above answer |

## Schema (automatic via App)

- `BlogPosting` + `FAQPage` from `faq-*` h3 blocks — do not duplicate manually.
- Hero `alt` descriptive; figures with `caption`.

## Template & colors

- Reuse existing: `BlogArticlePage`, `BlogBlockRenderer`, `.fc-blog-*` CSS, `--fc-blue`.
- Do NOT copy TalentRank purple; map to finCalc tokens only.

## LLM / llms.txt

- Site already has `public/llms.txt` + `llm.txt`; new URLs auto-listed after sitemap update.

## Ads

- Article pages: ads via `BlogBlockRenderer` + `BlogArticlePage` (keep).
- Blog index: no mid/page/bottom ads (user removed); top `blog-index` ad optional.

## Sort order

- `getBlogPosts()` sorts `datePublished` descending — newest first on `/blog` page 1.

